{
  "id": "book-28",
  "checkpoint": 12,
  "title": "Entering the Pine Forest",
  "summary": "Paul inicia sua subida pela trilha da floresta de pinheiros, descobre um riacho de água cristalina e encontra outro caminhante experiente.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/book-28.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "Paul begins his climb along the forest trail. Thick pine branches filter the bright sunlight, creating soft shadows across the damp earth. The scent of wood and fresh soil fills the air.\n\nAfter an hour of steady walking, the path winds upward beside a narrow creek. Pure cold water splashes over smooth grey stones. Paul pauses to rest his legs and fills his metal canteen.\n\nFurther up the slope, an experienced hiker with walking poles approaches from a side path. “Good afternoon,” the hiker calls out cheerfully. “Are you heading toward the base camp?”\n\n“Yes,” Paul replies, wiping sweat from his forehead. “How is the trail ahead?”\n\n“The climb becomes steeper near the ridge,” the hiker warns gently. “Keep an even pace, watch your footing, and enjoy the wild scenery.”\n\nPaul thanks him and resumes his journey with renewed energy.",
